---
import { MASTHEAD, SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="footer-band mt-16">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-6 px-4 py-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:px-6">
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-3xl uppercase leading-none">{MASTHEAD}</p>
      <p class="kicker mt-2">{SITE_NAME} · Presses never stop · Past performance guarantees nothing</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <li><a class="filter-chip" href="/">Front page</a></li>
        <li><a class="filter-chip" href="/leaderboard/">Leaderboard</a></li>
        <li><a class="filter-chip" href="/methodology/">Methodology</a></li>
        <li><a class="filter-chip" href="/press/">Press kit</a></li>
        <li><a class="filter-chip" href="/changelog/">Changelog</a></li>
        <li><a class="filter-chip" href="/about/">About &amp; licensing</a></li>
        <li><a class="filter-chip" href="/embed/">Embed the ticker</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <span class="kicker">Credits ·</span>
        Scores combine public datasets; every number links to its source on the{' '}
        <a class="underline" href="/methodology/">methodology page</a>. Exposure measures what AI can do to an
        occupation's tasks, not whether the job disappears.
      </p>
      <p data-attribution>
        <span class="kicker">Attribution ·</span>
        Employment projections and AI exposure categories: U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics (public domain). Tasks and
        related occupations: O*NET 31.0 Database by the U.S. Department of Labor, Employment and Training Administration,
        used under CC BY 4.0. AI applicability scores: Microsoft Research, "Working with AI" (CC BY 4.0). Occupation
        exposure: OpenAI, "GPTs are GPTs" (MIT License). Type set in Anton and Archivo (SIL Open Font License) and
        Permanent Marker (Apache License 2.0) via Google Fonts.
      </p>
      <p class="kicker">© {year} {SITE_NAME} · Gallows humor with receipts · AI exposure ≠ job loss · humanobsolescenceindex.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
